  {
    "id": "2089537620766302656",
    "authorName": "Ben Lacroix",
    "authorHandle": "@BLacroix30",
    "platform": "twitter",
    "content": "A departure from the norm but still feels like the Bendy world. The grittiness and unsettling environments mixed in with the brutalness and the various enemies is a very fun change to have fun with. Looking very good indeed! Alright, I'm going back to work now. 🖤💛",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-18T02:19:25Z",
    "media": [],
    "localAvatarPath": "assets/developers/blacroix30/avatar.jpg",
    "referenceType": "quote",
    "referenceUrl": "https://twitter.com/themeatly/status/2089530949520310528",
    "referenceAuthor": "@themeatly",
    "referenceAuthorName": "theMeatly",
    "referenceAvatarUrl": "",
    "referenceText": "The Cage is looking very good. :) Definitely an offshoot from the main Bendy art style, but I'm proud of the deep moody, surreal tone. The line work is a fun departure from the cartoony feel of the studio and leans more into the unrelenting metal and strict world of the Keepers.",
    "referenceMedia": [],
    "linkCards": []
  },
  {
